# ffight at 31 kHz, from the pad alone: run with PAD_KIND=two (or the harness's --press at the same frames).
# Past the attract to the title, OPTION MODE, five down to CRT MODE, right for 512x256 31kHz (384 x 448
# double-scanned), three down to EXIT, then GAME START and the first fighter, and fight.
4500 press Pad A 6
4600 press Pad Down 6
4640 press Pad A 6
4720 press Pad Down 6
4740 press Pad Down 6
4760 press Pad Down 6
4780 press Pad Down 6
4800 press Pad Down 6
4830 press Pad Right 6
